<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2.8.2 故障排除 on 编程那些事儿</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/</link><description>Recent content in 2.8.2 故障排除 on 编程那些事儿</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 14:19:36 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>2.8.2.1 故障排除</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.1-Troubleshooting/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:53:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.1-Troubleshooting/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/troubleshooting"&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/troubleshooting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="2821-故障排除"&gt;2.8.2.1 故障排除&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　当聊天、智能体或内联建议未按预期工作时，请从观察到的症状开始。本文帮助你选择正确的诊断工具、解释结果，并在需要报告问题时收集有用证据。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2.8.2.2 调试聊天交互</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.2-DebugChatInteractions/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:53:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.2-DebugChatInteractions/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/chat-debug-view"&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/chat-debug-view&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="2822-调试聊天交互"&gt;2.8.2.2 调试聊天交互&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　智能体行为异常时，在更改提示词或配置之前检查受影响聊天会话的证据。本文帮助选择诊断视图、跟踪发生的情况并验证更改是否解决问题。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2.8.2.3 诊断提示词缓存</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.3-DiagnosePromptCaching/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:53:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.3-DiagnosePromptCaching/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/cache-explorer"&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/cache-explorer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="2823-诊断提示词缓存"&gt;2.8.2.3 诊断提示词缓存&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　某些语言模型提供商可以复用先前请求中未更改的前缀，而不是再次处理这些输入令牌。缓存浏览器比较聊天会话中的连续模型请求，帮助你调查该前缀的变化是否导致更高延迟或令牌用量。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>2.8.2.4 常见问题</title><link>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.4-FAQ/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:53:25 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://before80.github.io/prgms/tools/vscode/ai-in-vs-code/reference-and-help/troubleshooting/2.8.2.4-FAQ/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;原文链接: &lt;a href="https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/faq"&gt;https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/agents/agent-troubleshooting/faq&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#10;&lt;h1 id="2824-常见问题"&gt;2.8.2.4 常见问题&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　查找有关 VS Code 中 GitHub Copilot 访问、用量、聊天、智能体、内联建议和故障排除的答案。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;h2 id="github-copilot-subscription"&gt;GitHub Copilot 订阅&lt;/h2&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="can-i-use-vs-code-without-signing-in"&gt;可以在不登录的情况下使用 VS Code 吗？&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;　　可以。使用 VS Code 核心编辑器功能不需要账户。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>